Tandem 1.2.0, and the suite now refuses to drift

Turning shared cockpit back on rejoins the room it left instead of waiting for the code to be
pasted again. smoke.sh stopped being a script that prints things and hoping: fourteen
assertions, each of which prints FAIL and exits non-zero - the room both ways, a service
ordering reaching the other cockpit, an invite refused while shared is off, the room rejoined
after it is turned back on, and the sim bridge in all four directions: identity in, a switch in,
a switch asked back out, and a note across the room.
